Low-VRAM Setup (8GB GPU)
The ComfyUI + FLUX + WanVideo workflow is explicitly tested for low VRAM (≤8GB). For an even lighter option, FLUX.2 Klein 4B distilled model reduces the image generation overhead significantly.

Quick Start: Minimal Free Stack
Install ComfyUI with WanVideo plugin (via ComfyUI Manager)

Download: FLUX.1 Schnell (fast, Apache 2.0) + Wan 2.1 I2V 480p + Wan T5/CLIP/VAE

Load the Flux.1 + WanVideo workflow template

Generate still from your prompt (or load an existing image)

Set loop parameters: start frame = end frame = your image, duration = 4s

Export → run through lib/loopable-video-segmenter/ for beat-aligned looping

Surface in Twin OS Songs panel

This gives you a fully offline, zero-subscription Midjourney loop replacement that integrates directly with the existing digital-twin architecture.
